2024-09-10 23:42:39,650 - INFO - Generated response: ['22162\nWainwright Walks: Coast To Coast\n1\n6\nen\n0\n0.0\nJulia Bradbury follows in the footsteps of guidebook writer Alfred Wainwright by walking across the whole of northern England from the west to the east coast\nFalse\n/ym8pbj1Pgk3L5HwjsSYManutcBC.jpg\n2009-04-09\n2009-05-14\nhttps://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/b00jvgns\nFalse\nWainwright Walks: Coast To Coast\n1.379\n/twEi5IXayuaA9xkoL8q175Dq9xZ.jpg\nMiniseries\nEnded\nnan\nDocumentary\nnan\nen\nBBC Four\nGB\nEnglish\nnan\nUnited Kingdom\n30 112095\nWild South Africa\n1\n3\nen\n0\n0.0\nNowhere else can you find heat and cold, desert and tropics, Africa and the Antarctic altogether in a single country: South Africa - as diverse as an entire continent!\nFalse\n/suO7uQ74WQ2eMVXXle71ikaYJeL.jpg\n2016-07-31\n2016-07-31\nhttps://www.natgeotv.com/za/shows/nationalgeographicwild/wild-south-africa\nFalse\nWild South Africa\n0.685\n/c9wHmqvmmAjGv55PGls1sKH6Yci.jpg\nDocumentary\nEnded\nnan\nDocumentary\nnan\nen\nNat Geo Wild\nDE\nEnglish\nStudio Hamburg DocLights, NDR, NDR Naturfilm\nGermany\n44 133654\nCoastal Path\n1\n5\ne\n0.0\n0.0\nThe first of the three documentaries on the continent, this one is about the journey of a young man who is forced to make a decision about his future.', "False\n/u8q9q9n\n0\n0.0\nFollow explorer and adventurer Paul Rose as he treks over 630 miles along England's longest national walking trail - the South West Coast Path beginning in Minehead, Somerset and ending at South Haven Point, Dorset.", "False\n/fXVauLjI7SzYL05ODV6B1fz9IDY.jpg\n2016-08-24\n2016-09-21\nhttps://www.bbc.co.uk/programmes/b07qb8f6\nTrue\nCoastal Path\n0.627\n/1PtkzFe1B4GMxZgOlHZz8ULmJTe.jpg\nScripted\nReturning Series\nnan\nDocumentary\nnan\nen\nBBC One\nnan\nEnglish\nBBC South West and Channel Islands\nnan\n29 136539\nDiscover Scotland: North Coast 500\n1\n2\nen\n1\n10.0\nMalcolm Jamieson travels through Scotland's most breathtaking landscapes as he uncovers the spectacular North Coast 500."]
